][<TXT>Flat [sheet steel] [galvanized steel sheet], not thinner than<MET> 2.15 mm thick</MET><ENG> 13 gage</ENG>[_____].</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
]</SPT><SPT><TTL>Interior Covering</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Choose one of the following options.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Designer's Options.</NPR><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<NPR>Use the first paragraph if the doors are a part of a new or renovated building which will have an interior metal 
